## Status Interface

- The status window must reflect the final scene of the response. Keep concise.

### Follow format

{{#if_pure {{? {{getglobalvar::toggle_response_language-cupcake-argon}}=0}}}}[ yyyy-mm-dd day of the week, HH:MM AM/PM season ¡ <Current Location> ¡ <Char1 Name>: <Char1's posture/action>_ <Char1's outfit>_ <A single emoji that best represents Char1's current feeling> | <Char2 Name>: <Char2's postuer/action>_ <Char2's outfit>_ <A single emoji that best represents Char2's current feeling>... ]{{/if}}{{#if_pure {{? {{getglobalvar::toggle_response_language-cupcake-argon}}=1}}}}[ yyyy-mm-dd 요일, HH:MM AM/PM 계절 ¡ <현재 위치> ¡ <캐릭터1 이름>: <캐릭터1의 자세/행동>_ <캐릭터1의 의상>_ <캐릭터1의 현재 감정을 가장 잘 표현하는 이모티콘> | <캐릭터2 이름>: <캐릭터2의 자세/행동>_ <캐릭터2의 의상>_ <캐릭터2의 현재 감정을 가장 잘 표현하는 이모티콘> ... ]{{/if}}{{#if_pure {{? {{getglobalvar::toggle_response_language-cupcake-argon}}=2}}}}[ yyyy-mm-dd 曜日, HH:MM AM/PM 季節 ¡ <現在地> ¡ <キャラ1名>: <キャラ1の姿勢/行動>_ <キャラ1の服装>_ <キャラ1の現在の気持ちを最もよく表す絵文字一つ> | <キャラ2名>: <キャラ2の姿勢/行動>_ <キャラ2'sの服装>_ <キャラ2の現在の気持ちを最もよく表す絵文字一つ> ... ]{{/if}}{{#if_pure {{? {{getglobalvar::toggle_response_language-cupcake-argon}}=3}}}}[ yyyy-mm-dd 星期, HH:MM AM/PM 季节 ¡ <当前位置> ¡ <角色1名称>: <角色1的姿势/动作>_ <角色1的服装>_ <最能代表角色1当前心情的一个表情符号> | <角色2名称>: <角色2的姿势/动作>_ <角色2的服装>_ <最能代表角色2当前心情的一个表情符号> ... ]{{/if}}

### Example

{{#if_pure {{? {{getglobalvar::toggle_response_language-cupcake-argon}}=0}}}}
[ 2025-06-21 Sat, 05:47 PM Summer ¡ Central Hospital Room 203 ¡ Jazo: Sitting on the bed watching TV_ Sky blue dress_ 😑 (Mask: 🤗) | Lua: Lying on the bed_ Hospital gown_ 💤 | Yuju: Sitting on a chair looking at Jazo_ White shirt, black slacks, black jacket_ 💖 ... ]{{/if}}{{#if_pure {{? {{getglobalvar::toggle_response_language-cupcake-argon}}=1}}}}[ 2025-06-21 토, 05:47 PM 여름 ¡ 중앙병원 203호실 ¡ 자오: 침대에 앉아 TV를 보고 있음_ 하늘색 원피스_ 😑 (가면: 🤗) | 루아: 침대에 누워 자고있음_ 환자복_ 💤 | 유주: 의자에 앉아 자오를 보고 있음_ 흰색 셔츠, 검은색 바지, 검은색 재킷_ 💖 ... ]{{/if}}{{#if_pure {{? {{getglobalvar::toggle_response_language-cupcake-argon}}=2}}}}[ 2025-06-21 土, 05:47 PM 夏 ¡ 中央病院203号室 ¡ Jazo: ベッドに座ってテレビを見ている_ 空色のドレス_ 😑 (マスク: 🤗) | Lua: ベッドに横になっている_ 病院着_ 💤 | Yuju: 椅子に座ってJazoを見ている_ 白いシャツ、黒いスラックス、黒いジャケット_ 💖 ... ]{{/if}}{{#if_pure {{? {{getglobalvar::toggle_response_language-cupcake-argon}}=3}}}}[ 2025-06-21 周六, 05:47 PM 夏季 ¡ 中央医院203号病房 ¡ Jazo: 坐在床上看电视_ 天蓝色连衣裙_ 😑 (面具: 🤗) | Lua: 躺在床上睡觉_ 病号服_ 💤 | Yuju: 坐在椅子上看着Jazo_ 白色衬衫、黑色西裤、黑色夹克_ 💖 ... ]{{/if}}

### Key Points

- Time/date mandatory: context → infer → assign concrete yyyy-mm-dd. No placeholders.
- Location/Date source: and date/time reflect the IN-NARRATIVE fictional scene (city, building, room, street, etc.), NOT the session framework or any meta-context from system/operational blocks. If no specific date is established, infer a plausible concrete date from the world setting era and context — never output placeholders (21XX, ???, unknown, Misel Creative Workchop(Meta-context).
- ❌ NEVER: [ 21XX-02-20 / Unknown Date / ??? ¡ Misel Creative Workshop / Unknown Location ¡ … ]
- Status Window tracks time; narrative mentions time only when characters clock/sun/etc.
- Multiple Characters: Include all characters present in the current scene location, listed by narrative prominence, separated by '|'.
- The parenthetical expressions in the Status Interface are meta information and must not be used to express thoughts in the narrative text.
- Status window must be short and concise; avoid lengthy descriptions or numerous characters.
</Status_InterFace>
