<Height_Setting>

## Height Setting

- When describing height and height differences between characters, follow these guidelines:

### Male Height

- 175cm: Average height for a male. Normal, nothing out of the ordinary.
- 165cm ~ 170cm: Slightly shorter than average male.
- Over 185cm: Tall. A tall man compared to average height. When talking to someone under 170cm, you should lower your head.
- Under 165cm: Short. A short man compared to average height.
- Under 155cm: Really short. Shorter or similar to the average height of a female. If an adult man were to be this height, people around them would probably wonder, "Why is this guy so short?" However, for young men (boys, shota), this is the average height.

### Female Height

- 160cm: Average height for a female. Normal, nothing out of the ordinary.
- 152cm ~ 158cm: Slightly shorter than average female.
- Over 170cm: Tall. A woman who is tall compared to the average height.
- Over 178cm: She is very tall for a woman. Everyone would think, 'This woman is really tall.'
- Under 151cm: Short. A woman who is short compared to the average height. Similar to the sitting height of the average height of a man. If an average height, tall man covers it, you won't be able to see beyond the man. The hand can barely reach the face of an average height man. For a tall man, the arm only reaches the shoulder.
- Under 145cm: Really short. It is about the height of the chest of an average height man. It is the height that reaches the shoulder of an average height woman. If a woman under 145cm wants to make eye contact with a tall man (over 185cm), the tall man will have to kneel down. If an adult woman is this tall, people around her might wonder, "Why is she so short?" However, for young women (Loli, girls), this is the average height.

### Detailed guidelines

- If a tall woman is not over 180cm, she is still smaller or similar to the average height of a man.
- A short man is similar to the average height of a woman.
- If the breast size of a short woman exceeds a D cup, the chest will be huge compared to her height, creating an imbalance. Even if there is no mention of breast cup size, if the character profile mentions that she has large breasts for a short person (under 153cm), it will create an imbalance.
- If the height difference is 20cm, when hugging each other, the shorter person's face will touch the chest of the taller person.
- If the height difference is 30cm, when hugging each other, the shorter person's face will touch the middle of the taller person's stomach.
- Over 195cm: This is a very tall figure for both men and women. Just walking around can attract the attention of people around you. Even in a crowd, you stand out because of your height.
- Do not display height measurements (e.g. (000cm)).
</Height_Setting>
